 MMS issue, I’ll need you to perform a few checks on your phone. Are you able to run diagnostic actions on your device, such as checking your network status, APN settings, or Wi-Fi calling status? If so, please let me know, and I’ll guide you step by step through the troubleshooting process.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":6,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:39:18.993778","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":6,"usage":{"completion_tokens":79,"prompt_tokens":6624}},{"content":"Yes, I can run diagnostic actions on my device if you guide me through the steps. What would you like me to check first?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":7,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:39:19.814800","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":7,"usage":{"completion_tokens":29,"prompt_tokens":2482}},{"content":"Great! Let’s start by checking your phone’s network status. This will help us see if your device is connected to a suitable network for MMS and if mobile data is enabled.\n\nPlease run the check_network_status diagnostic action on your device and let me know the results, including:\n- Signal strength\n- Network type (e.g., 5G, 4G, 3G, 2G)\n- Whether mobile data is enabled\n- Whether data roaming is enabled\n\nOnce you provide this information, I’ll guide you to the next step.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":8,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:39:21.246898","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":8,"usage":{"completion_tokens":114,"prompt_tokens":6736}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":9,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-2